Package: MANDALA
Title: Multiscale Aggregation and Neighborhood Data Analysis for Local Architecture in Spatial and Single Cell RNA Sequencing Study
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-09-27
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nicolas", "Ho", , "nicolas.ho@uottawa.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3192-3049")),
    person("Arvind", "Mer", , "amer@uottawa.ca", role = c("aut", "fnd"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8510-7963")))
Description: MANDALA provides intuitive solutions to visualizing
    differences among cells in single-cell and spatial RNA-seq datasets.
    Cells are aggregated into bubbles or hexagonal bins before rendering,
    so identity, local density, gene expression and metadata remain legible
    at atlas scale. Interactive viewers are written as self-contained HTML 
    and allow exports into vector or high res PNG. Runs locally
    in R on Seurat v3, v4 and v5 objects.
